 "transcript": [
  "[action] The eldest son returns from a trip with Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung stands and stares at his son.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a good thing and I am proud of it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands with his back to his father.",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at his son with amazement.",
  "[action] The eldest son eats and looks at his father with indifference.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son invites his father to eat.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What sort of thing is this?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"What sort of thing?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What is it, my son?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a cake and it is made of rice and the rice is from the north and it is sweet and good. It is a cake of the great cities.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I have never eaten such a thing in my life,\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son offers his father a taste of the cake.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung refuses the cake.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"It is too expensive and I am not used to it.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, you can eat it if you wish,\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung expresses his lack of experience with sweets.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I have never eaten anything like this and I do not know how to eat it.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and the second will eat it, my son!\""
